{"kind":"thread","id":"th/{A518F3B3-C743-4D43-8F24-4B5FAD0B4E8A}","sheet":"Assumptions","target":"D41","status":"1","text":"Judgement: allocate 10% of H1 performance fees to Q1 and 90% to Q2. Q1/Q3 disclosures provide AUM, not earnings. This allows limited intra-half crystallisations while concentrating recognition in the reporting half-end quarter. It is not a disclosed quarterly result. Change this input to test timing; H1 and FY totals stay fixed.","comments":[{"id":"{A518F3B3-C743-4D43-8F24-4B5FAD0B4E8A}","text":"Judgement: allocate 10% of H1 performance fees to Q1 and 90% to Q2. Q1/Q3 disclosures provide AUM, not earnings. This allows limited intra-half crystallisations while concentrating recognition in the reporting half-end quarter. It is not a disclosed quarterly result. Change this input to test timing; H1 and FY totals stay fixed.","authorId":"{E318F780-FD6E-4553-A307-152AE3F8479B}","createdAt":"2026-09-14T16:33:13.8700000Z"}]}
{"kind":"thread","id":"th/{9E2C135F-F8EE-4D5D-866F-EDB81E504D9B}","sheet":"Assumptions","target":"D42","status":"1","text":"Judgement: allocate 10% of FY less H1 performance fees to Q3 and 90% to Q4. Forecasts copy the corresponding 2025 estimated quarter, as required by the exercise. This timing is an assumption, not observed seasonality.","comments":[{"id":"{9E2C135F-F8EE-4D5D-866F-EDB81E504D9B}","text":"Judgement: allocate 10% of FY less H1 performance fees to Q3 and 90% to Q4. Forecasts copy the corresponding 2025 estimated quarter, as required by the exercise. This timing is an assumption, not observed seasonality.","authorId":"{E318F780-FD6E-4553-A307-152AE3F8479B}","createdAt":"2026-09-14T16:33:13.8700000Z"}]}
{"kind":"thread","id":"th/{EE8B9BC0-216C-49ED-BDDB-C319B1100EE3}","sheet":"Assumptions","target":"D50","status":"1","text":"Uses the published 2025 average net management-fee margin of 56bp, held flat under the exercise. H1 2026 reported 52bp and year-end 2025 run-rate margin was 52bp. Forecast assumes a recovery to the 2025 average. Midpoint AUM is a proxy; historical fees / midpoint AUM need not exactly match the published fund-level margin.","comments":[{"id":"{EE8B9BC0-216C-49ED-BDDB-C319B1100EE3}","text":"Uses the published 2025 average net management-fee margin of 56bp, held flat under the exercise. H1 2026 reported 52bp and year-end 2025 run-rate margin was 52bp. Forecast assumes a recovery to the 2025 average. Midpoint AUM is a proxy; historical fees / midpoint AUM need not exactly match the published fund-level margin.","authorId":"{E318F780-FD6E-4553-A307-152AE3F8479B}","createdAt":"2026-09-14T16:33:13.8700000Z"}]}
{"kind":"thread","id":"th/{CE437C96-4E8F-43E1-A742-DAED2FBCE51B}","sheet":"Assumptions","target":"D51","status":"1","text":"All fixed compensation is assigned to the management-fee business, consistent with treating disclosed performance-fee compensation as variable. ($481m management compensation less $274m fixed) / $1,077m net management fees = variable management compensation ratio.","comments":[{"id":"{CE437C96-4E8F-43E1-A742-DAED2FBCE51B}","text":"All fixed compensation is assigned to the management-fee business, consistent with treating disclosed performance-fee compensation as variable. ($481m management compensation less $274m fixed) / $1,077m net management fees = variable management compensation ratio.","authorId":"{E318F780-FD6E-4553-A307-152AE3F8479B}","createdAt":"2026-09-14T16:33:13.8700000Z"}]}
{"kind":"thread","id":"th/{0EFBCE22-A056-4A37-9930-C6491BACCF46}","sheet":"Assumptions","target":"D52","status":"1","text":"Company groups seed investment gains with performance-fee profits. Allocate disclosed $194m performance-fee compensation across $281m fees plus $38m seed gains at one 2025 participation ratio. This is a model attribution. A zero fee scenario removes the fee-linked compensation; seed-linked compensation remains with the seed gain assumption.","comments":[{"id":"{0EFBCE22-A056-4A37-9930-C6491BACCF46}","text":"Company groups seed investment gains with performance-fee profits. Allocate disclosed $194m performance-fee compensation across $281m fees plus $38m seed gains at one 2025 participation ratio. This is a model attribution. A zero fee scenario removes the fee-linked compensation; seed-linked compensation remains with the seed gain assumption.","authorId":"{E318F780-FD6E-4553-A307-152AE3F8479B}","createdAt":"2026-09-14T16:33:13.8700000Z"}]}
{"kind":"thread","id":"th/{32FF70A8-0AE0-4555-93E4-4829463A88E9}","sheet":"Assumptions","target":"D53","status":"1","text":"Calibrated blended servicing cost per dollar of midpoint total AUM. Company quotes around 5bp on a narrower AUM perimeter excluding systematic long-only; applying 5bp to total AUM would overstate costs. This blended rate assumes a stable servicing mix.","comments":[{"id":"{32FF70A8-0AE0-4555-93E4-4829463A88E9}","text":"Calibrated blended servicing cost per dollar of midpoint total AUM. Company quotes around 5bp on a narrower AUM perimeter excluding systematic long-only; applying 5bp to total AUM would overstate costs. This blended rate assumes a stable servicing mix.","authorId":"{E318F780-FD6E-4553-A307-152AE3F8479B}","createdAt":"2026-09-14T16:33:13.8700000Z"}]}
{"kind":"thread","id":"th/{CD45BCBD-1572-4B49-A496-EE34E6284B4C}","sheet":"Assumptions","target":"D56","status":"1","text":"Use unrounded ratio $86m/$407m, approximately 21.13%, rather than rounded published 21%. Apply to forecast quarters only; actual H1 2026 tax and shares stay reported.","comments":[{"id":"{CD45BCBD-1572-4B49-A496-EE34E6284B4C}","text":"Use unrounded ratio $86m/$407m, approximately 21.13%, rather than rounded published 21%. Apply to forecast quarters only; actual H1 2026 tax and shares stay reported.","authorId":"{E318F780-FD6E-4553-A307-152AE3F8479B}","createdAt":"2026-09-14T16:33:13.8700000Z"}]}
